[agent:result] 62	### Email Notification Events
[agent:result] 63	
[agent:result] 64	| Event | Description |
[agent:result] 65	|-------|-------------|
[agent:result] 66	| `on_start` | When job run starts |
[agent:result] 67	| `on_success` | When job run completes successfully |
[agent:result] 68	| `on_failure` | When job run fails |
[agent:result] 69	| `on_duration_warning_threshold_exceeded` | When run exceeds duration warning threshold |
[agent:result] 70	| `on_streaming_backlog_exceeded` | When streaming backlog exceeds threshold |
