[agent:result] 358	### Retry Behavior
[agent:result] 359	
[agent:result] 360	- Retries only apply to task failures
[agent:result] 361	- Each retry is a new task attempt
[agent:result] 362	- Retry count resets for each job run
[agent:result] 363	- Dependencies wait for retries to complete
